      "notes": [
        "Hoddmimis now shows per-process and subtree storage read/write activity on Linux, macOS, and Windows. New columns can be sorted and configured, and the Inspector includes current values and history. Processes the operating system will not expose are shown as unavailable instead of reporting a misleading zero.",
        "The saved-filter button now keeps its full label, and the snapshot save icon is centered consistently with other icon-only actions."
